{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A game made for the ones we lost on the way.</u></strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/extras/0ee6ac9ffd6ed4c67716d539f316b2c8.avif?t=1745547843\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br>Experience a surreal, linear walking simulator that explores the themes of death and grieving the passing of a loved one. Waking up in a unknown forest, you find yourself lost and looking for answers, will you find what the clarification you have been looking for or will you find more questions then answers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dealing with grief and loss</h2>A thing that everyone is forced to deal with for as long as humankind came into being is loss and grief. So we wanted to make a game that wasn't just special to us but that can also be special to people struggling with the same issues.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A show don't tell journey</h2>Memento Mori is a show, don't tell experience that can be enjoyed by anyone and everyone no matter what language they speak due to the lack of dialogue and text.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/extras/2896ef9764e0e6b833e3c45c12ce920d.poster.avif?t=1745547843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/extras/2896ef9764e0e6b833e3c45c12ce920d.webm?t=1745547843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/extras/2896ef9764e0e6b833e3c45c12ce920d.mp4?t=1745547843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WolfWare Studios</h2>WolfWare Studios is a independent game development duo who started making Memento Mori during the second quarter of 2022. Before the production of Memento Mori both Shea Kelly (Creative lead) and Alekzandar Voynikov (Technical lead) made video games for game jams and to produce a medium they have both loved for as long as they can remember.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Memento Mori","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2974290/683eab16916abd16265e7fe60894239ae3185848.jpg"},{"name":"Memento unus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2974290/207b0248506b7f87b4ba9e55dd718f40e735e36d.jpg"},{"name":"Memento duo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2974290/6b13ead7771a91e77a96110ddc58d5ebadd3b987.jpg"},{"name":"Memento tribus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2974290/4d9e758a326d085036c70bdbca49a6d01e676879.jpg"},{"name":"Memento quattuor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2974290/0150065e57c38cabcbae6e71600f6ebc46d7e41b.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974290?t=1745547843","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745547843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745547843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745547843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>A game made for the ones we lost on the way.</u></strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/extras/0ee6ac9ffd6ed4c67716d539f316b2c8.avif?t=1745547843\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br><br>Experience a surreal, linear walking simulator that explores the themes of death and grieving the passing of a loved one. Waking up in a unknown forest, you find yourself lost and looking for answers, will you find what the clarification you have been looking for or will you find more questions then answers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dealing with grief and loss</h2>A thing that everyone is forced to deal with for as long as humankind came into being is loss and grief. So we wanted to make a game that wasn't just special to us but that can also be special to people struggling with the same issues.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A show don't tell journey</h2>Memento Mori is a show, don't tell experience that can be enjoyed by anyone and everyone no matter what language they speak due to the lack of dialogue and text.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/extras/2896ef9764e0e6b833e3c45c12ce920d.poster.avif?t=1745547843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/extras/2896ef9764e0e6b833e3c45c12ce920d.webm?t=1745547843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974290/extras/2896ef9764e0e6b833e3c45c12ce920d.mp4?t=1745547843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WolfWare Studios</h2>WolfWare Studios is a independent game development duo who started making Memento Mori during the second quarter of 2022. Before the production of Memento Mori both Shea Kelly (Creative lead) and Alekzandar Voynikov (Technical lead) made video games for game jams and to produce a medium they have both loved for as long as they can remember.","developers":["Shea Kelly","Alekzandar Voynikov"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akama